    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "EVIDENCE",
      "narration_text": "This is the classical picture, and it is real. One hundred training examples, held fixed. Add parameters and test error falls, because the model finally has the capacity to represent the pattern. Keep adding and it climbs again, because now it is fitting the noise in those hundred examples. Best point: sixty parameters. The rule says stop here.",
