            "at": "0.25",
            "event": "curve draws left to right, falling"
          },
          {
            "at": "0.55",
            "event": "it bottoms out around sixty parameters"
          },
          {
            "at": "0.75",
            "event": "it turns and climbs — the textbook U is complete"
          },
          {
