    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "EVIDENCE",
      "narration_text": "Now watch what the textbook crops out. The axis has to be redrawn to fit it. Push past one hundred parameters, the number of training examples, and the error does not merely climb, it detonates. A hundred and eleven. A hundred and fifty-nine times worse than the best you had. And then, if you keep going, it comes back down, and it lands below the classical best.",
