    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "EVIDENCE",
      "narration_text": "And your training loss cannot tell you any of this. At one hundred parameters it reaches zero and stays there. Every model to the right fits the training data perfectly. The dotted line is flat on the floor from the cliff onward while the solid one swings through a factor of nearly four hundred. Training loss stops being a signal exactly when you need one.",
